{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04ND:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:d4c2219df4d7a4e58a72ed03932537fe5e0f720e3473c373b8e226c6509fb2c5", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 302278, "byte_start": 300905, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:41b2b273cda41f25189f7193a98ec24e3d6ec68d65188831bab5f3b923365067", "line_end": 7966, "line_start": 7928}, "owner_tag": "04ND", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{O}_{U', u'} & \\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\ar[l] \\\\\n\\mathcal{O}_{U, u} \\ar[u] & \\mathcal{O}_{V, v} \\ar[l] \\ar[u]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$R = \\mathcal{O}_{V, v}$", "MATH_0003": "$S = \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "MATH_0004": "$M = \\mathcal{O}_{U', u'}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{V, v}} \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}\n\\longleftarrow\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'}\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\mathcal{O}_{U', u'}\n\\longleftarrow\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{V, v}} \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-local-source-target-at-point}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-section-etale}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-local-flat-ff}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-permanence}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-base-change}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-map-between-etale}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1e5df2742906c484091061786a8ec60719d996300cc615831946e7402453d1d8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f03fd9da1ef7390b82168047380d5b546484fee16c8b5485f5723b7618ad7cd0", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nGiven a diagram as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>\nwe obtain the following diagram of local homomorphisms of local rings\n<MATH_0001>\nNote that the vertical arrows are localizations of <ACCENT_0001>tale ring maps,\nin particular they are essentially of finite presentation, flat,\nand unramified (see\nAlgebra, Section <REF_0002>).\nIn particular the vertical maps are faithfully flat, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nNow, if the upper horizontal arrow is flat, then the lower horizontal\narrow is flat by an application of\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0004>\nwith <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> and\n<MATH_0004>. If the lower horizontal arrow is\nflat, then the ring map\n<MATH_0005>\nis flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0005>.\nAnd the ring map\n<MATH_0006>\nis a localization of a map between <ACCENT_0002>tale ring extensions of\n<MATH_0007>, hence flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e27a9deb163d99016b54ef5c013390ecd27fe38fbb12228489f2a78e906aa968", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04ND:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04NI:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:cef9bcc6c4620586580556041027ebf7a7bf55ede18deed8c8849b50511642b9", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 303183, "byte_start": 302588, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:3f72e142f7cae9349d78df5470f49bf98e32d2f33731618fbf30b8d31bb4a08f", "line_end": 7992, "line_start": 7981}, "owner_tag": "04NI", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0003": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0004": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$U'_v \\to U_v$", "MATH_0002": "$U' \\to U$", "MATH_0003": "$U'_v$", "MATH_0004": "$V'_v$", "MATH_0005": "$V'_v$", "MATH_0006": "$\\kappa(v)$", "MATH_0007": "$v' = \\Spec(\\kappa(v'))$", "MATH_0008": "$U'_{v'}$", "MATH_0009": "$U'_v$", "MATH_0010": "$U'_{v'} \\to U'_v \\to U_v$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-etale-over-field}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-section-etale}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:511be6378a6428bfd3ab0b6ed9d6b39b6f6ffaff2caa8ae7f05d4dab3f9d75ed", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e1dd51da0784a1eb8f3dd4365fa47ab227748add57dbfac7e6ce3b219d7795fc", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nNote that <MATH_0001> is <ACCENT_0001>tale as a base change of the <ACCENT_0002>tale\nmorphism <MATH_0002>. The scheme <MATH_0003> is a scheme over <MATH_0004>. By\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>\nthe scheme <MATH_0005> is a disjoint union of spectra\nof finite separable field extensions of <MATH_0006>.\nOne of these is <MATH_0007>. Hence\n<MATH_0008> is an open and closed subscheme of <MATH_0009> and it follows\nthat <MATH_0010> is <ACCENT_0003>tale (as a composition of an\nopen immersion and an <ACCENT_0004>tale morphism, see\nMorphisms, Section <REF_0002>).\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a13678863eeb43e84f01f6a60f544a21abd9a22ae5004ded1ddfb76fcb9c8d78", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04NI:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04NI:lemma/0001", "hash": "sha256:b33a172544456e6e17153c32ed2e3279fa9342dfd310f60cbff4244e4a14af19", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 302586, "byte_start": 302280, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:86f2e1be7acb9d7fe758e8a6edd79b7d1780e922aadd909888fdeacc11efb0d5", "line_end": 7979, "line_start": 7968}, "owner_tag": "04NI", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-etale-on-fiber}", "MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nU' \\ar[r] \\ar[d] & V' \\ar[d] \\\\\nU \\ar[r] & V\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$v' \\in V'$", "MATH_0003": "$v \\in V$", "MATH_0004": "$U'_{v'} \\to U_v$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:413141d7c4fa397c1a9abb4922a58a6d5e6e3af0ca196b0ad34bf64b2808576c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e35128470d000233c1ff768497bbc3b44143435a38810e4e5f2d02d6902c1ba0", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nConsider a commutative diagram of morphisms of schemes\n<MATH_0001>\nwith <ACCENT_0001>tale vertical arrows and a point <MATH_0002> mapping to <MATH_0003>.\nThen the morphism of fibres <MATH_0004> is <ACCENT_0002>tale.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6c5191c3e05f2f3338e5d1b5917d98e036b417376f3b3e07c64b77c327c06d46", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04NI:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04R5:paragraph/0003", "hash": "sha256:3dd358cda749648ab5e3dc57d7d71294f88792969cae48e991287e725457e985", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 303421, "byte_start": 303185, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:9fa0c03eef3ba266469c7e3b7eb618aa8ec4f046609f76d74f842ae66f6b70e6", "line_end": 7998, "line_start": 7994}, "owner_tag": "04R5", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(X, x) \\to (S, s)$", "MATH_0002": "$(U_s, x)$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\to S$", "MATH_0004": "$(X_s, x)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:27ce5d6fd07b29bb3e80fe9ac4b07ca2bd187fe1550cca2940e36d4e845e3697", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ed65c8a20e9e3e88bd4df802f83d35e040e1cf23d859e8447ad2c31cf6449d36", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nGiven a morphism of germs of schemes <MATH_0001>\nwe can define the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>fibre<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> as the isomorphism class of germs\n<MATH_0002> where <MATH_0003> is any representative. We will often abuse notation\nand just write <MATH_0004>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:181fd8079f7d45fadbc7b09520338b7758b63a3df46daa1653247ad3e7f965e2", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04R5:paragraph/0003"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04NJ:lemma/0001", "hash": "sha256:4a2ac75dd0661dde380179ad403f845783f0272c8f8a79e4fc2c243476b19f1c", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 303730, "byte_start": 303423, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:e7da6ae74d22ecc9f316d64a856441e1139693a1f8e1982783102ec718e610de", "line_end": 8011, "line_start": 8000}, "owner_tag": "04NJ", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-dimension-local-ring-fibre}", "MATH_0001": "$d \\in \\{0, 1, 2, \\ldots, \\infty\\}$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n\\mathcal{P}_d((X, x) \\to (S, s)) =\n\\text{the local ring }\n\\mathcal{O}_{X_s, x}\n\\text{ of the fibre has dimension }d\n$$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c8ade5a0447bfd090b4d97ccbd68b8b47ef03bcd06d53b400aac4a73358db13c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:224eb03a24310d39597f77ad5011e19b129691062a671caf8c82ab55a3774590", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001>.\nThe property of morphisms of germs\n<MATH_0002>\nis <ACCENT_0001>tale local on the source-and-target.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:738a4b1a30f2ddca7823a01af3e5c619dfe05f33977b5889e58d7f1bf55b92b7", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04NJ:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:morphisms-lemma-etale-over-field", "hash": "sha256:fc40d59fb4007de5b774dcbe8a8077515445db7a9a4d57671aa94fad595264d5", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 297788, "byte_start": 297199, "file": "morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:25ce1b8abba2bedcc751b5ad2adabccf76f797d3bfea75112f87c426d242f9e1", "line_end": 8190, "line_start": 8174}, "owner_tag": "02GL", "parent_tag": "02GH", "requested_label": "morphisms-lemma-etale-over-field", "requested_tag": "02GL", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02GH", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0003": "\\'e", "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-etale-over-field}", "LOCKED_0002": "\\begin{slogan}\nDescription of the \\'etale schemes over fields and fibres\nof \\'etale morphisms.\n\\end{slogan}", "MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$k$", "MATH_0003": "$X \\to \\Spec(k)$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$k$", "MATH_0006": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0007": "$s \\in S$", "MATH_0008": "$X_s$", "MATH_0009": "$\\kappa(s)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2da7ef9c73938907d7c3ac09b3eb8db5da4d7e249aa5208bdfdc87ae70be99d4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:303c850aecf379fe3576cfbd2d62541818ca0596a3fb9da7cf5fba54fd4ab45d", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\n<LOCKED_0002>\nFibres of <ACCENT_0001>tale morphisms.\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme over a field <MATH_0002>.\nThe structure morphism <MATH_0003> is <ACCENT_0002>tale if\nand only if <MATH_0004> is a disjoint union of spectra of finite separable\nfield extensions of <MATH_0005>.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0006> is an <ACCENT_0003>tale morphism, then for every <MATH_0007> the\nfibre <MATH_0008> is a disjoint union of spectra of finite separable field\nextensions of <MATH_0009>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5ed968fb945dca7165a982e3196587b1e3e2755a8c44ef759ee3b3083418a222", "unit_id": "inventory:morphisms:02GL:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:morphisms-section-etale", "hash": "sha256:8a91b38007c6ff168566e9e861d4b41c8bfa1868ead82e6d0214054fc25c4dba", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 292124, "byte_start": 292075, "file": "morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:0934f0a1eb5101abcb9fc4e8688e2ee5113b006f96d0aa3b9488ee6965e6a0db", "line_end": 8035, "line_start": 8034}, "owner_tag": "02GH", "parent_tag": "02GH", "requested_label": "morphisms-section-etale", "requested_tag": "02GH", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "02GH", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'E", "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{section-etale}", "TEXTCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTOPEN_0001": "\\section{"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:43356df9e194ada9ebdf85c7511d3920